{"version":1,"content":"<html><body><p>無綫（TVB）小生黎諾懿與家族坐擁逾5億美容王國的前港姐李潔瑩（Nicole）於2014年11月11日結婚，婚後育有大仔「小春雞」黎峰睿及細仔「小冬牛」黎奕辰，一家四口幸福美滿。昨日（11日）兩人迎來結婚12周年「絲婚」紀念日，雖然黎諾懿忙於工作，未能陪老婆慶祝，但仍非常有心思地遙距送上浪漫驚喜，兩公婆更分別在社交平台分享短片放閃！</p><figure><img alt=\"李潔瑩（Nicole）曾在2007年參選港姐。（IG@nicgogo）\" src=\"https://cdn.hk01.com/di/media/images/dw/20251113/1065676598126055424384965.jpeg/-1fbC45a5v4wRb2UxUiBqGLi7_oYtDY9eoiCiXqIgok\"/><figcaption>李潔瑩（Nicole）曾在2007年參選港姐。（IG@nicgogo）</figcaption></figure><figure><img alt=\"黎諾懿與太太李潔瑩現身尖沙咀出席《慧妍雅集43週年慈善晚宴2025》。（葉志明攝）\" src=\"https://cdn.hk01.com/di/media/images/dw/20250329/982782984190955520918623.jpeg/4KQdLXtmLDcR7PjMNOUwX1j0w_4vy-fJtX3aZI992mQ\"/><figcaption>黎諾懿與太太李潔瑩現身尖沙咀出席《慧妍雅集43週年慈善晚宴2025》。（葉志明攝）</figcaption></figure><figure><img alt=\"一家四口住在市值過億的何文田複式豪宅，生活幸福美滿。（IG@nicgogo）\" src=\"https://cdn.hk01.com/di/media/images/dw/20260707/1151226425580326912471950.jpeg/99caMnQrHLOwf0ZcCtE_Zd9NS3KYX-wR9HYwxPR2MMQ\"/><figcaption>一家四口住在市值過億的何文田複式豪宅，生活幸福美滿。（IG@nicgogo）</figcaption></figure><figure><img alt=\"拍拖。（IG截圖）\" src=\"https://cdn.hk01.com/di/media/images/dw/20260828/1170068365989908480958713.jpeg/BnP7CcsP3SSJ39M1ruLME40nipzHWIsT0-lKI9PpSiM\"/><figcaption>拍拖。（IG截圖）</figcaption></figure><figure><img alt=\"一家四口幸福美滿。（IG@nicgogo）\" src=\"https://cdn.hk01.com/di/media/images/dw/20260812/1164241958407770112419078.jpeg/nPWNzW7HHWfIy9z8TyENSXFyAWTaIB5KZCz0S2Qs9Es\"/><figcaption>一家四口幸福美滿。（IG@nicgogo）</figcaption></figure><p>李潔瑩收巨型紅玫瑰難掩甜笑　催老公返屋企湊仔</p><p>李潔瑩在社交平台上載短片，並寫道：「第12年結婚週年❤️ Happy 12th Wedding Anniversary Hubby 等你返屋企湊仔🤣🤣🤣 fighting ~ ❤️🫶🏻 第12個1111 ❤️」片中所見，李潔瑩頭戴白色Cap帽、身穿淺藍色間條恤衫，素顏上陣依然皮膚白滑緊緻，狀態極佳！李潔瑩手抱老公送上的巨型紅玫瑰，對着鏡頭露出幸福甜笑，身後牆上更掛滿一家人的溫馨家庭照，兩個寶貝仔「小春雞」及「小冬牛」亦輪流入鏡搶鏡，三母子貼頭嘟嘴自拍，畫面既溫馨又搞笑。</p><figure><img alt=\"黎諾懿結婚12周年遙距送花放閃。（影片截圖）\" src=\"https://cdn.hk01.com/di/media/images/dw/20261112/1197593759827628032514983.jpeg/OIJanpCCw4rrtitQrFiV44wGYbyh3V9Jm6OVjpujlY4\"/><figcaption>黎諾懿結婚12周年遙距送花放閃。（影片截圖）</figcaption></figure><figure><img alt=\"李潔瑩同大仔。（影片截圖）\" src=\"https://cdn.hk01.com/di/media/images/dw/20261112/1197593478075387904157490.jpeg/cNJYspPnYLfLBQtPw3y9AQZOpWN0mmsdVgyTG1YMkxs\"/><figcaption>李潔瑩同大仔。（影片截圖）</figcaption></figure><figure><img alt=\"溫馨！（影片截圖）\" src=\"https://cdn.hk01.com/di/media/images/dw/20261112/1197593475831304192580319.jpeg/_QCdKPLg5NhmodHGjIMgIQ9vxHd0IyNdLKwlcSysJXE\"/><figcaption>溫馨！（影片截圖）</figcaption></figure><figure><img alt=\"溫馨！（影片截圖）\" src=\"https://cdn.hk01.com/di/media/images/dw/20261112/1197593767071584256569318.jpeg/j83aGYDCXTLQds6ngBF2YqhLRMpHspnioQ7uIqEO7iI\"/><figcaption>溫馨！（影片截圖）</figcaption></figure><figure><img alt=\"等老公返屋企湊仔！（影片截圖）\" src=\"https://cdn.hk01.com/di/media/images/dw/20261112/1197593764689088512798361.jpeg/s_DVP8n7iB31B0e2g9c3AbfmCxWopr1FSEhTPEhIUzw\"/><figcaption>等老公返屋企湊仔！（影片截圖）</figcaption></figure><figure><img alt=\"等老公返屋企湊仔！（影片截圖）\" src=\"https://cdn.hk01.com/di/media/images/dw/20261112/1197593762105266176923564.jpeg/hu0aEf-wuzi2qYP5CIR-LKoYd1PT7BnVa2u02mtrtNo\"/><figcaption>等老公返屋企湊仔！（影片截圖）</figcaption></figure><p>黎諾懿剪輯12年家庭點滴示愛　無懼「五億駙馬」標籤用行動證真情</p><p>而一向是圈中「愛妻號」的黎諾懿亦有分享短片，並簡單而深情地寫道：「結婚12周年快樂 11.11 #結婚周年」，短片中剪輯了兩人過去12年來的珍貴合照，每一幕都洋溢着滿滿愛意。出身富裕的李潔瑩，家族經營美容生意，旗下開設逾10間美容纖體中心，更持有多個工商、住宅物業，估計身家逾5億，黎諾懿亦因此被封為「5億駙馬」。雖然黎諾懿兒時要靠綜援生活、住過劏房，兩人一度被指「女尊男卑」，但他未有理會閒言，一直默默耕耘，努力賺錢養家，近年更轉型做綜藝節目監製，同樣有聲有色！兩人結婚12年恩愛如昔，羡煞旁人！</p><figure><img alt=\"甜蜜點滴。（影片截圖）\" src=\"https://cdn.hk01.com/di/media/images/dw/20261112/1197590779137232896325867.png/byWKeQSe7ju88-CWEBJg1s9ouDC8wmx77B6Z4-wemeM\"/><figcaption>甜蜜點滴。（影片截圖）</figcaption></figure><figure><img alt=\"甜蜜點滴。（影片截圖）\" src=\"https://cdn.hk01.com/di/media/images/dw/20261112/1197590776998006784350468.png/XBaXt9ZJaVsPqer1H2v5eu6Ml9kZNhbp-OkbmPjpG5g\"/><figcaption>甜蜜點滴。（影片截圖）</figcaption></figure><figure><img alt=\"溫馨。（影片截圖）\" src=\"https://cdn.hk01.com/di/media/images/dw/20261112/1197590781641363456415962.png/kptjribbNAwrrKZXoqUXnKF2_-hKkChWnk6D555Og-c\"/><figcaption>溫馨。（影片截圖）</figcaption></figure><figure><img alt=\"溫馨。（影片截圖）\" src=\"https://cdn.hk01.com/di/media/images/dw/20261112/1197590783612817408378204.jpeg/o6Vqd4TBPTYbOmvXyLbrp5RDTHmuUd7b5kkc7eZJHO0\"/><figcaption>溫馨。（影片截圖）</figcaption></figure><figure><img alt=\"李潔瑩爸爸70歲大壽。（IG@nicgogo）\" src=\"https://cdn.hk01.com/di/media/images/dw/20250823/1035975982009552896574980.jpeg/dT2Nni4aMhChfFgVyX5MrdRkymJ9wR9kDwNwbQ8DcG0\"/><figcaption>李潔瑩爸爸70歲大壽。（IG@nicgogo）</figcaption></figure><figure><img alt=\"好恩愛。（IG@nicgogo）\" src=\"https://cdn.hk01.com/di/media/images/dw/20250813/1032348679140282368982534.jpeg/l6HlHAWrQt00qjk4okySWSsFQad69EFPvoQkV76EJFc\"/><figcaption>好恩愛。（IG@nicgogo）</figcaption></figure><figure><img alt=\"好恩愛。（IG@nicgogo）\" src=\"https://cdn.hk01.com/di/media/images/dw/20250813/1032348688330526720768293.jpeg/Xmpda-f1QP_kt2BNX7iiqOe_GhCcLYdEIwhQKSMIUCk\"/><figcaption>好恩愛。（IG@nicgogo）</figcaption></figure></body></html>","scraped_at":"2026-11-12T13:44:26.729734+00:00","quality":{"score":2,"chars":1050,"images":18,"source":"HK01 娛樂","fallback":"none","origin":"article-html","completeness":"extracted"},"published_at":"2026-11-12T13:30:29+00:00","fetched_at":"2026-11-12T13:57:29.169308+00:00","content_updated_at":"2026-11-12T13:37:59.496021+00:00","content_hash":"99f6cb815e8071ab3e472361ce1cf479e2fd19671576072c2bb69219e03c7cb1","evidence_status":"full","scrape_error":null,"content_retention":null,"content_capture":null}